	\L_0192e:
	\L_01816:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_0193b:
	\L_0192e:
	\L_01886:
	ZH 1:
	'General Rick... I’m happy to'
	R
	'know you feel that way about'
	R
	'me. Thank you very much...'
	\L_0193b:
	ZH 1:
	'But as long as I have Queen'
	R
	'Lia... She’s all I need.'
	R
	'Even if she loves King Rance...'
	\L_0193b:
	\L_0192e:
	\L_01816:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_0193b:
	\L_0192e:
	\L_01886:
	ZH 1:
	'General Rick...'
	R
	'Please don’t forget what I'
	R
	'just told you a moment ago.'
	\L_0193b:
	ZH 1:
	'Much like you yearn for me,'
	R
	'there’s a girl that yearns for'
	R
	'you... Please notice her...'
